scoreboard players add $shooters mms.arrows 1
scoreboard players operation @s shooter_id = $shooters mms.arrows
=== data/arrows/function/read_vector.mcfunction
data modify storage arrows:launch motion set from entity @s Pos
kill @s
=== data/arrows/function/shoot_cow.mcfunction
execute anchored eyes positioned ^ ^-0.7 ^1.5 summon cow run function arrows:shoot_cow/_exec0
playsound entity.cow.ambient neutral @a
=== data/arrows/function/shoot_cow/_exec0.mcfunction
data modify storage arrows:mms l."launch".speed set value "1.5"
function arrows:launch
=== data/arrows/function/spotted.mcfunction
tag @s add arrows.seen
execute if data entity @s item.components."minecraft:custom_data".arrow run function arrows:arm
=== data/arrows/function/stuck.mcfunction
execute on passengers if entity @s[tag=arrows.stand_in] run function arrows:impact
kill @s
